    <abstract pn="section-abstract">
      <t indent="0" pn="section-abstract-1">This document clarifies and relaxes the IANA rules for Multimedia
Internet KEYing (MIKEY).  This document updates RFCs 3830, 4563,
5410, and 6043; it obsoletes RFC 4909.</t>
    </abstract>
